@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11
skinparam swimlaneWidth 220
|Purchasing Employee|
start
:Open minimum stock overview;
|System|
:Retrieve physical warehouse stock by medicine;
:Compare physical quantities with minimum stock thresholds;
if (Any medicines below minimum?) then ([yes])
  :Display shortage list with current and minimum quantities;
  |Purchasing Employee|
  :Select a medicine requiring replenishment;
  :Start AD02 Reorder products;
else ([no])
  :Display that all products meet minimum stock;
endif
stop
@enduml
